Upgrading this fork
===================

After pulling a newer version, apply the schema and configuration changes below.
For an existing database, first apply the consolidated migration below. It
seeds `dovecot_quota` from the legacy columns before retiring them:

    mysql < contrib/migrations/2026-06-fork-schema.sql

Then let the panel migrate its own database — run

    ./bin/vimbtool.php -a maintenance.cli-schema-update

on deploy/upgrade (the Docker image runs this automatically at container
start). The migration creates `dovecot_quota`, seeds it from old
`maildir_size` values, and drops the retired `maildir_size`, `homedir_size`,
and `size_at` columns. Review the `application.ini` config changes in the
release notes before
restarting the application.

(The old upstream wiki at opensolutions/ViMbAdmin is no longer maintained.)
